  "title": "NR-RRC : Fix NR-RRC RSRQ upper boundary value from -20dB to 20dB",
  "description": "according to NR-RRC related 3GPP spec.\nThe reporting range of “SS-RSRQ” is defined from -43 dB (RSRQ_0) to 20 dB (RSRQ_127) with 0.5 dB resolution.\nthe upper boundary value should be 20 dB , not -20 dB existed in currently wireshark code.\n\nhttps://www.lteprotocol.com/2022/03/rsrp-rsrq-rssi-sinr-range-in-5g.html",
